ble for provisioning. Your app appears in the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"From Apps on Your iPhone"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" section.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"User selects your app"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — The SDK displays available cards using the card art you provide.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authentication"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"shouldAuthenticateUser()"},{"type":"text","text":" returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":", Apple Wallet presents your UI Extension. Your UI Extension calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"completeAuthorization(result:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when done."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Provisioning"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" — The SDK handles the provisioning request using the session token from your "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sessionToken(paymentInstrumentIds:)"},{"text":" method.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Card is added to Apple Wallet","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK handles all the provisioning logic internally. Your Non-UI Extension subclass only needs to provide the session token, card art, keychain access group, and authentication preference."}]}],"style":"note","type":"aside"},{"anchor":"Troubleshooting","level":2,"text":"Troubleshooting","type":"heading"},{"text":"App does not appear in Wallet’s “From Apps on Your iPhone”","anchor":"App-does-not-appear-in-Wallets-From-Apps-on-Your-iPhone","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"co